1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,150
Woman: How's your job at the campus bookstore going?

2
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:11,000
Man: Pretty good. It was really hectic last week

3
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:14,270
which is no surprise because the semester is just starting.

4
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:19,500
Woman: Right. I actually avoided all that by ordering my books online

5
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,160
It was a smart move.

6
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:23,760
Man: Things have calmed down, thankfully

7
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:29,122
I think this actually might be my last semester at the bookstore,

8
00:00:29,122 --> 00:00:36,200
though. I heard that the tutoring center is looking for biology tutors. That's my major. So.
